    "story": "From up there, every man on the ground looks like the enemy. That's the arithmetic of the sky, and the only correction for it is a man willing to stand tall in the open and be read like a sign. Wave. Wave like your life is spelled with your arm — because down in the grass are a dozen more lives spelled the same way, and the pilot has one pass to read them all. The roar goes over like weather. The arm stays up until it has been understood.",
