    "story": "The smoke is the address. Everything behind them is water and everything ahead of them is that grey column rising off the ground they have been assigned, and the walk between the two is the last ordinary thing the day will ask of them. A man can think on a walk. He can inventory his courage, spend a little, save a little. The line keeps its pace because the pace is the last normal thing they own, and nobody wants to arrive at the smoke out of breath and out of order.",
